WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.631
Schema inference is convenient for exploration Spark
can look

00:00:05.657 --> 00:00:11.370
at data and guess types But inferred types can be
wrong especially for identifiers

00:00:11.542 --> 00:00:17.251
dates mixed values or sparse columns For production
workflows

00:00:17.277 --> 00:00:23.251
and important assignments an explicit schema is
often safer because it documents the expected
structure
